SUMMARY:Creating Content for Anthological Podcasts
DESCRIPTION:This engaging course bridges the gap between theory and practice. It equips participants with the essential skills needed for producing narrative podcasts\, focusing on preparation\, story selection\, structural development and scriptwriting\, alongside delivery and vocal variety to suit the narrative. Creating Content for Anthologicaly Podcasts takes participants on a unique journey into the heart of podcast creation\, focusing on the craft itself rather than the technical world of recording equipment and hardware. This captivating program targets content creators\, as well as anyone passionate about discovering this field for personal or professional growth. It is equally enriching for storytell
LOCATION:Ithra Tower - Level 9\, Classroom 2
